{"id":"858b9f13e23a0836eaf70f6cfb5cbfa6dd2ea8f6","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244361","title":"对比了一下 deepseek v4 和 mimo 2.6 的价格","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"dmonz","excerpt":"程序员 - @dmonz - Deepseek 平时主要下班和周末个人项目用，参考了最近一个月的 token 消耗和费用，换算到 mimo 之后能省一半呢![]( https://i.v2ex.co/Z6Gr57KB.pn","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>Deepseek 平时主要下班和周末个人项目用，参考了最近一个月的 token 消耗和费用，换算到 mimo 之后能省一半呢</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.v2ex.co/Z6Gr57KB.png\"></p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-09-24 13:54:20 +08:00\">10h 31m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <div><p>昨天试了下mimo tp的API，确实很慢。关掉深度思考能快一些，但降智严重，对比ds和mimo关掉深度思考，用一道很简单的计算题测试，mimo 3次请求错了两次，ds全对。</p>\n<p>更明显的差距是缓存命中率，基本推翻了前面费用降低50%的推论：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DeepSeek V4 Flash</th>\n<th>MiMo v2.6 Flash</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.v2ex.co/aENTwbd1.png\"></td>\n<td><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.v2ex.co/AQvCtCVf.png\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121283\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e46/6c99/372530_normal.png?m=1751365665\" alt=\"duanxianze\" data-uid=\"372530\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/duanxianze\">duanxianze</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 22:52:10 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>mimo 2.6 很慢，接口反应就有点慢，推理也过长，不如 deepseek ，嗖嗖的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121301\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/03f1652f783bd476a6bfddff504ef2ef?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dmonz\" data-uid=\"65727\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dmonz\">dmonz</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 23:01:18 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/duanxianze\">duanxianze</a> deepseek 确实快啊，不过 mimo 可以关闭深度思考。不知道缓存命中率如何？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121583\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b60769fe4536ae3385f9d6f13d52bdc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hxy100\" data-uid=\"41391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hxy100\">hxy100</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 07:32:04 +08:00\">16h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感受同一楼，mimo 2.6 确实慢，产出质量马马虎虎，还过得去。不清楚慢是不是 Agent 的问题（用的 opencode Desktop ）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121622\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4105/08ab/73070_normal.png?m=1762737894\" alt=\"luckyc\" data-uid=\"73070\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/luckyc\">luckyc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 08:22:10 +08:00\">16h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>慢在哪里? 能给出数据么? 这是我检测到的:<br>mimo-v2.6-flash 大约 70t/s<br>gpt-6-luna 大约 23t/s</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121796\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5bb099a5da54832591c4f76561d83926?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"shellic\" data-uid=\"293607\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shellic\">shellic</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:00:55 +08:00\">15h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>mimo2.6 能力还可以，就是这个速度有点拉胯，太慢了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18121882\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2c5e4e866a976b0a86e710350f44e18b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kekxv\" data-uid=\"350466\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kekxv\">kekxv</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:15:01 +08:00\">15h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>去网页测试，能够直观的感受慢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122096\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3e9f/0fc9/4848_normal.png?m=1788992063\" alt=\"txican\" data-uid=\"4848\"></td>\n              